{"id":"mount-kilimanjaro","name":"Mount Kilimanjaro","qid":"Q7296","country":"Tanzania","locality":"Kilimanjaro Region","lat":"-3.066666666","lon":"37.359166666","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"Pliocene","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"massif; dormant volcano","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Kilimanjaro","text":"Mount Kilimanjaro () is a large dormant stratovolcano in Tanzania. It is the highest mountain in Africa and the highest free-standing mountain above sea level in the world, at 5,895 m (19,341 ft) above sea level and 4,900 m (16,100 ft) above its plateau base. It is also the highest volcano in the Eastern Hemisphere and the fourth most prominent peak on Earth.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Kilimanjaro","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vi--mount-kilimanjaro","game":"civilization-vi","name":"Mount Kilimanjaro","verified":false,"text":"is a natural wonder in the Civilization games.","text_source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/Mount_Kilimanjaro","text_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","images":[{"id":"gh-p57e8674cfdc","w":584,"h":502,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Historic_Moment_Mount_Kilimanjaro_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Xanthos of Thebes on 2020-05-23"}},{"id":"gh-pe8af30813b4","w":186,"h":215,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Mount_Kilimanjaro_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by ZeroOne on 2017-03-27"}}]},{"id":"civilization-vi-gathering-storm--mount-kilimanjaro","game":"civilization-vi-gathering-storm","name":"Mount Kilimanjaro","verified":false,"text":"is a natural wonder in the Civilization games.","text_source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/Mount_Kilimanjaro","te